  ('RELIGION.PRIVACY', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'RELIGION', 'RELIGION · PRIVACY', 0, 11, 'What is recorded about members — confessions, giving records, counselling notes, attendance — who can read it, and can a member have it deleted on leaving?', 'A stated privacy line per domain with an explicit revocation right.', 'Access that cannot be revoked is not sharing; it is monitoring.', 'Check whether the member with no standing to ask could withdraw access today without a confrontation. If not, that is the real rule.', 'Confession, counselling and giving records are the member''s own. Using them to discipline, expose or retain a member is named here as a breach, not a governance style.'),
