  ('FAMILY.PRIVACY', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'FAMILY', 'FAMILY · PRIVACY', 0, 11, 'What stays each person''s own here — devices, history, friendships, therapy — and is any monitoring happening that the monitored person does not know about?', 'A stated privacy line per domain with an explicit revocation right.', 'Access that cannot be revoked is not sharing; it is monitoring.', 'Check whether the dependant and the unpaid caregiver could withdraw access today without a confrontation. If not, that is the real rule.', 'Privacy is not evidence of wrongdoing. A request for it is never recorded as a finding.'),
  ('FAMILY.TRUST', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'FAMILY', 'FAMILY · TRUST', 0, 12, 'What would end this for each adult here, and what is currently unresolved that both have agreed not to raise?', 'A named breach threshold per party and an inventory of open matters.', 'Arrangements are entered carrying unresolved matter everyone has agreed not to mention.', 'If the list of open matters is empty, ask each party separately. Empty lists are usually courteous.', 'A matter raised here is met once without retaliation, or the question should not have been asked.'),
  ('FAMILY.FUTURE_CHANGE', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'FAMILY', 'FAMILY · FUTURE CHANGE', 0, 13, 'What change in one of us would this household survive, what would it not, and when do we deliberately revisit all of this?', 'A named set of foreseeable changes, a response to each, and a review date in a calendar.', 'Agreements without a review date are enforced against people who have since changed.', 'Test five concrete changes rather than a general willingness to adapt.', 'Any party may call a review early without justifying why.'),
  ('FAMILY.DEAL_BREAKERS', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'FAMILY', 'FAMILY · DEAL BREAKERS', 0, 14, 'What is each adult unwilling to accept under any circumstance, and what is on the floor whether they named it or not?', 'Short unsoftened limit lists, plus a stated floor nobody can remove by agreement.', 'A limit that is never stated is discovered only by being crossed.', 'Check each item is genuinely absolute. Anything with a condition belongs in another axis.', 'Coercion, retaliation, harm to dependants, and control of another''s money, documents or care are on the floor and are not removable by agreement.'),
  ('FAMILY.REPAIR', 'QYRIS-INDUSTRY-001', null, 'FAMILY', 'FAMILY · REPAIR', 0, 15, 'When one of us has hurt the other, what actually repairs it in actions — and what do we do the fourth time?', 'A repair sequence that can be followed while upset, and a named escalation for repetition.', 'Arrangements survive on repair capacity far more than on initial compatibility.', 'Check the sequence includes a behaviour change, not only an acknowledgement. Count repeats; four is a number, not a mood.', 'Repair is not the harmed party''s job, and non-acceptance of a repair is not punished.')
